- ly (display manager)
- i3wm (window manager)
- i3status (status bar)
- picom (compositor used to apply visual effects)
- kitty (terminal)
- nvim (text editor)
- fastfetch (system information viewer)
- cmatrix (matrix rain)
- neomutt (terminal email client)
- htop (terminal based nerdy looking system stats viewer)
- maim, xclip, libnotify, xdotool (provides features like region select, clipboard copy, notification popup, annotation)
- dunst (notification daemon)
- lsusb (provided by usbutils in arch linux core repository)
- evince (gui document viewer)
- browser (brave, firefox, qutebrowser)
- nautilus (file explorer)
- code (vs-code-oss from official arch linux repository)
- obs-studio ( free, open-source application for live streaming and video recording)
